   "description": "When Ling's attached target causes normal attack, deals additional Frost DMG equal to 300%/150% (Melee/Ranged attached Blackguard) of Ling's Spell Power. The DMG is considered as normal attack, also affected by the target's Damage Boost, Normal Attack Crit Chance, Crit Damage and so on; the DMG won't trigger any other effects; the DMG dealt will also be reduced when the target trigger Bounce.",
   "scaling": [],
   "name_zh": "花之和弦"
